OL,3,GNEWSA'Driving a bus is easier than
OL,4,Adriving a car'
OL,5,
OL,6,FHow would you feel about swapping your
OL,7,F4m (13ft) long car for a bus nearly
OL,8,Fthree times as long and towering above
OL,9,Fthe traffic?
OL,11,FAt a Stagecoach open day in Portsmouth
OL,12,Fattended by the BBC, those who have
OL,13,Falready made the switch said it can
OL,14,Factually be easier than you might
OL,15,Fthink.
OL,17,FAnd the company is hoping more women in
OL,18,Fparticular will discover that for
OL,19,Fthemselves, with the latest industry
OL,20,Ffigures suggesting females account for
OL,21,Fonly about 10% of bus drivers.
OL,23,APub: 15-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB S Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
